Hi Kurt,

As reflected in more recent OP monthly minutes, the final
decision was to use the Jekyll framework on GitHub for the
new OP website.  Sahil, Nilanjana, and others have been
meeting weekly w/ Aveek and Till and have made good
progress.  There should be an entirely new OP website
early in 2019.

Cheers,
- Ira
